      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree, I think that if they had multiple tiers it would be beneficial to the VRChat players and VRChat as a company. They could offer cheaper tiers for players who might just want a boost of credibility (aka. payment info) but don't care about stickers and such. But they could also have some premium tiers for people who might be developers and world creators. People who might like private cloud storage, premium server access (80+ instances), priority customer service tickets. There are people that would pay $30-50 a month if it meant they had more priority working with VRChat support.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
