      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes. I suggest a VRC+ Lite where you get all features but limited or where you get to choose a number of festures to unlock. It's very expensive now and I'm sad what is happening with VRC and now having full new features being paywalled. I hate division based on money.\n\nAnf I think more people would sign up for it and later upgrade than people would downgrade.",
