  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-07T08:47:52.175Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello! Just before we start, the goal is NOT to replace the current VRC+ but to add a more affordable option for those who can’t afford the existing VRC+.\n\nAs you know, VRChat is a free game, and to support the developers, you can buy VRC+ and enjoy plenty of new customization options and features.\n\nHowever, for some people (myself included), the current VRC+ is a bit pricey.\n\nIf I want to support the developers without spending too much on VRChat, a second, more affordable VRC+ option (similar to Discord’s Nitro Basic and regular Nitro) would be fantastic.\n\nHere’s an example :\n\nVRC+ : 9,99 per month\n\n-300 fav avatar\n\n-custom emoji\n\n-sticker\n\n-nameplate icons\n\n-paralax menu backdrop\n\n-photo invite\n\n-more trust\n\n-possibility to create group\n\nVRC Access : 3,99 per month\n\n-150 fav avatar\n\n-custom emoji\n\n-sticker\n\n-more trust\n\n-possibility to create group\n\n(It’s just a suggestion of what the cheaper option could be; I haven’t included all the features, only those listed on the VRC+ presentation page on the VRChat website.)\n\nThe cheaper VRC+ would be a win-win for both developers and players! More players will be able to purchase a subscription to vrchat, which means more revenue for the developers, and players get access to great features without spending too much money !",
